%---
%[output:1c4db2be]
%   data: {"dataType":"text","outputData":{"text":"    StudentID          Case           Objective    Solver     Curtailment_MWh    Loss_MWh    GridCost_Yuan    MaxConeGap    SimultaneousPower_MW    MinACVoltage    MaxACVoltage\n    _________    _________________    _________    _______    _______________    ________    _____________    __________    ____________________    ____________    ____________\n\n    2.424e+08    \"case_nongcun\"          \"A\"       \"mosek\"       -2.941e-07      0.91473         30631        6.3378e-10             0                0.97365          1.0442   \n    2.424e+08    \"case_nongcun\"          \"B\"       \"mosek\"           10.163      0.57079         37983         1.952e-10             0                0.97365               1   \n    2.424e+08    \"case_nongcun\"          \"C\"       \"mosek\"       -2.748e-08        1.869         28414         0.0022974             0                   0.95          1.0624   \n    2.424e+08    \"case_chengshi_A\"       \"A\"       \"mosek\"      -6.0526e-05      0.35577         15816        1.5353e-07             0                0.97277          1.0177   \n\n","truncated":false}}
